.TH SDL_HINT_MOUSE_NORMAL_SPEED_SCALE 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_MOUSE_NORMAL_SPEED_SCALE \- A variable setting the speed scale for mouse motion, in floating point, when the mouse is not in relative mode.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_MOUSE_NORMAL_SPEED_SCALE \(dqSDL_MOUSE_NORMAL_SPEED_SCALE\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This hint can be set anytime\[char46]

